CM 7-el Yagi @206.5 MHz (geometry-optimized for lowest SWR, NO matching network)
CM This version adjusts reflector/driven/director-1 lengths & spacing
CM to raise feed impedance toward ~40–45 ohms and reduce SWR.
CE

SY rw=0.01
SY seg=41
SY freq=206.5

' --- Updated lengths (rebalanced for higher Zin) ---
SY Lr=0.748183' shorter reflector increases feed R
SY Ld=0.715286' longer driven raises impedance
SY L1=0.531636' slightly longer director1 shifts coupling
SY L2=0.614531
SY L3=0.626025
SY L4=0.589034
SY L5=0.57185

' --- half lengths ---
SY hr=Lr/2
SY hd=Ld/2
SY h1=L1/2
SY h2=L2/2
SY h3=L3/2
SY h4=L4/2
SY h5=L5/2

' --- Updated spacings to lift R-in ---
SY xr=-0.3415' reflector moved closer for higher R
SY xd=0.000
SY x1=0.199993' director1 moved further to reduce loading (raises R)
SY x2=0.395513
SY x3=0.11389
SY x4=1.31916
SY x5=0.904286

' ------- GEOMETRY --------
GW 1 41  xr 0 -hr   xr 0 hr  rw
GW 2 41  xd 0 -hd   xd 0 hd  rw
GW 3 41  x1 0 -h1   x1 0 h1  rw
GW 4 41  x2 0 -h2   x2 0 h2  rw
GW 5 41  x3 0 -h3   x3 0 h3  rw
GW 6 41  x4 0 -h4   x4 0 h4  rw
GW 7 41  x5 0 -h5   x5 0 h5  rw

GE 0
GN -1

' feed
EX 0 2 21 0 1 0

FR 0 1 0 0 206.5
RP 0 361 1 1000 0 0 1 0 90
EN
